{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-08-24", "prepared_on": "2026-08-24", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-08-24</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Hugging Face reportedly explores sale, valued at up to $13B<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Hugging Face傳尋求出售，估值上看130億美元</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Business Insider reports that open-source AI platform Hugging Face is exploring a potential sale, with a valuation that could exceed $13 billion if the deal goes through.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">據Business Insider引述消息來源報導，開源AI平臺Hugging Face正探索出售可能性，若交易成真估值上看130億美元。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178366\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Microsoft patches perfect-score Entra ID vulnerability<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">微軟修補Entra ID滿分漏洞</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Microsoft issued a security advisory on August 20 for a remote code execution flaw (CVE-2026-69836) in Entra ID, scoring a maximum CVSS 10 and drawing attention after Microsoft indicated it had already been exploited.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟8月20日發布資安公告，修補Entra ID中CVSS滿分10分的遠端程式碼執行漏洞CVE-2026-69836，因該漏洞疑遭利用而備受關注。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178359\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> 659 Stripe merchant API keys leaked, exposing 35GB of customer data<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">659家Stripe商家API金鑰外洩，35GB客戶與付款資料遭公開</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">API keys from 659 Stripe merchant accounts were leaked and posted to a data trading forum on August 18, exposing roughly 35GB of data including nearly 690,000 customer records; Stripe itself was not breached.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">659家Stripe商家帳號的API金鑰於8月18日外流並被公開於資料交易論壇，涉及約35GB資料及近69萬筆客戶紀錄，Stripe本身並未遭入侵。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178361\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Who's behind the new 'stealth model' Ox Alpha?<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">神秘「隱身模型」Ox Alpha背後是誰？</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A mysterious new AI model called Ox Alpha has sparked intense online speculation about its creator and capabilities.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">一款神秘的新AI模型Ox Alpha掀起網路熱烈猜測，外界紛紛揣測其開發者身分與能力。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/23/whos-behind-the-new-stealth-model-ox-alpha/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Is it legal to train AI models on copyrighted books? It's complicated<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">用受版權保護的書籍訓練AI模型合法嗎？情況很複雜</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Most published authors have unknowingly contributed to training the very AI tools that now threaten their livelihoods, raising complex legal questions about consent and copyright.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">多數出版作者在不知情下已促成訓練出可能威脅其生計的AI工具，此現象引發著作權與同意權方面複雜的法律爭議。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/23/is-it-legal-to-train-ai-models-on-copyrighted-books-its-complicated/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Mojo compiler and toolchain now open source for developers<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">程式語言Mojo開源編譯器與工具鏈，供開發者自行建置與測試</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A week after releasing Mojo 1.0, Modular has open-sourced the Mojo compiler and toolchain under Apache 2.0 with an LLVM exception, letting developers build, modify, and test it themselves.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Modular在Mojo 1.0發布一週後，以Apache 2.0搭配LLVM例外條款開源Mojo編譯器與工具鏈原始碼，開發者可自行修改、建置與測試。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178352\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Canonical researches using LLMs to auto-convert large C codebases to Rust<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Canonical研究自動將大型C程式碼庫轉成Rust，結合LLM與程式驗證降低遷移風險</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Canonical and the University of Bristol have launched a three-year research project combining large language models, program analysis, and formal methods to reliably convert large C codebases into Rust.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Canonical與布里斯托大學展開3年研究合作，結合大型語言模型、程式分析與形式化方法，希望可靠地將大型C程式碼庫轉換為Rust，降低遷移風險與人工修正成本。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178351\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Flock CEO calls for 'compromise' as surveillance company faces growing backlash<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Flock執行長呼籲「妥協」，監控科技公司面臨輿論反彈</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Flock Safety is facing mounting public backlash over concerns that its surveillance technology could be misused, prompting its CEO to call for compromise.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">監控科技公司Flock Safety因外界擔憂其技術遭濫用而面臨日益增加的輿論壓力，執行長因此呼籲各方尋求妥協方案。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/23/flock-ceo-calls-for-compromise-as-surveillance-company-faces-growing-backlash/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Linkdaze's smart calendar is built to run a household, not just track a schedule<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Linkdaze智慧行事曆不只排程，還能管理整個家庭</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Linkdaze's smart digital calendar stands out by not putting core features behind a paywall, including an AI-powered meal planning tool.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Linkdaze推出的智慧數位行事曆不將核心功能鎖進付費牆，還內建AI餐點規劃工具。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/23/linkdazes-smart-calendar-is-built-to-run-a-household-not-just-track-a-schedule/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Enterprise PKI must adapt as TLS certificate lifespans shrink and PQC deadlines approach<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">TLS憑證效期縮短、FIPS 140-2驗證轉換與PQC期限逼近，企業PKI須同步調整</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Enterprise public key infrastructure faces simultaneous pressure from post-quantum cryptography transition, shortened TLS certificate lifespans, and changes to FIPS cryptographic module validation.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">企業公開金鑰基礎建設同時面臨後量子密碼學轉型、TLS憑證效期縮短與FIPS密碼學模組驗證制度變化的多重壓力。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178356\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}